    "created_at": "2024-11-08T19:12:15Z",
    "updated_at": "2024-11-08T19:12:15Z",
    "body": "Given the permission model for Bluetooth devices, I think only supporting a browser-wide simulated adapter makes sense. Automation needs to combine the use of the simulated adapter with automation of the Bluetooth permission prompt to grant a given site access to a simulated device.\r\n\r\nThinking about it from this perspective I don't know why I pushed so hard for it to be browsing-context specific.",
